title: "GABBE: Generative Architectural Brain Base Engine, an agentic software engineering kit"
abstract: >-
  A Markdown kit of skills, guides, personas and templates that gives a coding agent a
  software engineering lifecycle with human approval gates, plus an optional Python
  command-line tool and installers.
